'''Pord''' was a young [[Gamorrean]] [[pirate]] who belonged to [[Cyrus Vuundir|Taborr Val Dorn]]'s [[Taborr's gang|gang]]. She once [[Thief|stole]] [[fruit]] from the [[Kublop Springs marketplace]].<ref name="Taborr's Pirate Showdown">{{YJA|Taborr's Pirate Showdown}}</ref>

==Biography==
As a [[Youngling|child]], Pord was a member of a [[Taborr's gang|gang]] of [[pirate]]s led by [[Cyrus Vuundir|Taborr Val Dorn]]. Alongside him and the [[droid]] [[EB-3]], she repeatedly raided [[Hap's Sap Tap]], a [[Cafe|café]] on the [[forest]] [[planet]] [[Tenoo]]. During [[Raid on Hap's Sap Tap|one]] of these raids, Pord and the other pirates were confronted by [[Jedi]] [[Jedi Initiate|younglings]] [[Kai Brightstar]], [[Lys Solay]] and [[Nubs]]. Val Dorn told Pord and EB-3 to take the cart with their loot to their [[Iron Talon|starship]], but they were defeated by the Jedi. Val Dorn caused a distraction, allowing Pord and EB-3 to get away, but the Jedi managed to retrieve the stolen goods with the help of [[Nash Durango]] and other residents, causing the pirates to leave empty-handed.<ref name="The Young Jedi">{{YJA|The Young Jedi}}</ref>
{{Char-stub}}

==Personality and traits==
Pord was a young Gamorrean pirate with green skin and purple eyes.<ref name="TYJ">{{YJA|The Young Jedi}}</ref> Although she took pleasure in taunting others,<ref name="SWE" /> especially the Jedi, she was quick to flee when she lost her advantage.<ref name="TYJ" />
What she lacked in skill with her [[vibro-lance]], often stumbling over herself in attempts to use it,<ref name="SWE" /> she made up for in her sheer strength. She was strong enough to pull two rail cars together.<ref name="OTR">{{YJA|Off the Rails (episode)}}</ref> 

==Behind the scenes==
The [[Disney+]] audio description for "[[Taborr's Pirate Showdown]]" mistakenly uses he/him pronouns for Pord.<ref name="Pirate Showdown AD">{{YJA|Taborr's Pirate Showdown}} {{AD|Disney+}}</ref>

